<% content_for :title, "Privacy · Kept" %>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <div class="card">
    <p>Kept stores what you log — doses, symptoms, food, weight, workouts — to give you your plan. It is encrypted in transit and at rest.</p>
    <p>We never sell personal data, never use it for advertising and never share it with drug makers. You can export or delete everything at any time.</p>
    <p>If an employer or health plan sponsors Kept, they receive only de-identified, aggregate statistics for groups of at least 10 members.</p>
    <p>Kept uses a session cookie to keep you signed in. No third-party trackers.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>
